<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head>{% set title='둘러보기' %}{% include '_head.njk' %}</head><body class="interior-page explore-page">{% include '_header.njk' %}<main class="container py-5"><div class="page-label">EXPLORE</div><h1 class="section-title">작품 찾기</h1><p class="text-secondary mb-4">단어나 문장으로 취향에 맞는 N행시를 찾아보세요.</p><form class="row g-2 mb-4 explore-search" method="get" action="/poems"><div class="col"><label class="visually-hidden" for="keyword">검색어</label><input id="keyword" class="form-control form-control-lg" name="keyword" value="{{ keyword }}" placeholder="단어 또는 내용 검색"></div><div class="col-auto"><button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">검색</button></div></form><div class="row g-3 explore-grid">{% for poem in poems %}<div class="col-12"><article class="card poem-card shadow-sm"><div class="card-body p-4"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><h2 class="h4 fw-bold">{{ poem.word }}</h2><span class="rating">★ {{ poem.rating }}</span></div>{% for line in poem.lines %}<div class="poem-line"><strong>{{ poem.word[loop.index0] }}</strong><span>{{ line }}</span></div>{% endfor %}<a class="stretched-link" href="/poems/{{ poem.id }}"><span class="visually-hidden">상세 보기</span></a></div></article></div>{% endfor %}</div>{% if not poems.length %}<div class="empty-state"><h2>검색 결과가 없습니다</h2><p class="text-secondary">다른 검색어를 입력해 보세요.</p></div>{% endif %}</main>{% include '_footer.njk' %}</body></html>
